SaffronCity_Interior10_Text_Woman3::
	.string "Before the MAGNET TRAIN STATION was\n"
	.string "built, there was a house there.\p"
	.string "A little girl named COPYCAT used\n"
	.string "to live there.$"

SaffronCity_Interior10_Text_Scientist_1::
	.string "The MAGNET TRAIN is a super-modern\n"
	.string "rail liner that uses electricity\l"
	.string "and magnets to attain incredible\l"
	.string "speed.\p"
	.string "However, if there isn’t any\n"
	.string "electricity...$"

SaffronCity_Interior10_Text_Scientist_2::
	.string "Whew...\p"
	.string "How many times have I gone back\n"
	.string "and forth between KANTO and JOHTO?$"

SaffronCity_Interior10_Text_Woman1::
	.string "Hi. Do you have a rail PASS? I have\n"
	.string "one. All the people in SAFFRON who\l"
	.string "ride the MAGNET TRAIN have PASSES.$"

SaffronCity_Interior10_Text_MgDeliveryman_1::
	.string "I’m sorry, but the MAGNET TRAIN isn’t\n"
	.string "operating now.$"

SaffronCity_Interior10_Text_MgDeliveryman_2::
	.string "We’ll soon depart for GOLDENROD.\p"
	.string "Are you coming on board?$"

SaffronCity_Interior10_Text_Trigger::
	.string "We have arrived in SAFFRON.\p"
	.string "We hope to see you again.$"
